      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "The 63rd Golden Horse Awards take place in Taipei, Taiwan, with the Hong Kong film We Are Born Good winning Best Narrative Feature.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-22:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Organized by the Taipei Golden Horse Film Festival Executive Committee, the ceremony honors outstanding achievements in Chinese-language cinema from 2025 and 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387204839:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The ceremony took place on November 22, 2026, at the Taipei Music Center in Taipei, Taiwan.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387204839:0"
      ]
    },
